(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material - Unit 5: Scope and Exam Review) Tj
T*
(================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.1 Variable Scope and Namespaces) Tj
T*
(Python resolves identifiers using the LEGB hierarchy:) Tj
T*
(- Local: Names assigned inside the current function.) Tj
T*
(- Enclosing: Names defined in enclosing function closures.) Tj
T*
(- Global: Names defined at the module top level.) Tj
T*
(- Built-in: Predefined identifiers \(len, range, sum, int\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.2 Functions and Return Values) Tj
T*
(Functions without an explicit 'return' statement implicitly return None.) Tj
T*
(Be vigilant: printing a value \(print\(x\)\) is NOT the same as returning it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.3 Assessment Checklist for Foundations Exam) Tj
T*
([ ] Verify all while-loop index counters increment on every path.) Tj
T*
([ ] Double-check range\(start, stop\) excludes the stop value.) Tj
T*
([ ] Check list indexing bounds: index 0 to len-1 \(avoid IndexError\).) Tj
T*
([ ] Confirm accumulator initialization values \(0 for sum, 1 for product\).) Tj
T*
([ ] Test boundary conditions \(empty collections, single-item collections\).) Tj
T*
